  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"客户提交试用/付费订单后，服务商可通过此接口拉取订单数据。需配合【获取APP Access Token】和【获取授权时登录用户信息】接口使用。\",\"id\":\"serve_market.order.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/serve_market/order/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1736319607097355\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_app_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\",\"reason\":\"请求时需要应用级token，通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取APP Access Token\"},{\"id\":\"get_authorized_user_info\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697819831388174\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口获取授权用户user_id用于过滤订单\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取授权时登录用户信息\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1736319607097355\",\"title\":\"获取应用订单数据\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-IM7tmCIv\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iWQ7qKGd\">客户提交试用/付费订单后，服务商可通过此接口拉取订单数据</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kVYkpaiG\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">详见业务介绍见</span></span><a href=\"https://bytedance.feishu.cn/wiki/wikcnArvXc4ierIbAQ1YAlfBfJC#\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">【巨量引擎】应用市场简介（For服务商）</span></span></a></p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201781531146527962%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-TbnjISc8\" id=\"h6f20189-TbnjISc8\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-WAsmVscQ\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/serve_market/order/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/serve_market/order/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1736319607097355\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-egsgD6MY\" id=\"h6f20189-egsgD6MY\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-AClJiLn1\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-0YxIembH\" id=\"h6f20189-0YxIembH\">请求头</h3><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">App-Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-D2nvzv9M\">应用级token，区别于普通的Access Token，通过【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\">获取APP Access Token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hOgHRbNk\" id=\"h346b9f0-hOgHRbNk\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-g5QKQ6TB\">应用ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Rxc0cl35\">过滤条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4IIkPkDP\">按订单ID过滤，数组，支持N个入参，仅拉取应用相关的订单</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">use_uid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RdQcxqtk\">按使用用户ID过滤，仅支持一个入参，仅拉取应用相关的订单。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-FFEGYOnw\">通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697819831388174\" target=\"_blank\">获取授权时登录用户信息</a>】接口可以获取授权用户user_id，该user_id为巨量引擎的登录帐号ID（与手机号/邮箱一一映射）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">create_time_min</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EKPcz1hd\">订单创建时间最小值，秒级时间戳（如果累积订单超过1万笔，接口会返回错误，建议通过缩小创建时间范围来避免查询失败）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">create_time_max</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qiit8fcP\">订单创建时间最大值，秒级时间戳（如果累积订单超过1万笔，接口会返回错误，建议通过缩小创建时间范围来避免查询失败）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YdGGgp4N\">页码，默认值0</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sI0OI2of\">分页数量，默认20，最大支持100</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-OJbXF4n0\" id=\"h346b9f0-6NeYYbYx\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fserve_market%2Forder%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20app_id%20%3D%20APP_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20order_id_list%20%3D%20ORDER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20order_id%20%3D%20json.dumps(order_id_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20use_uid%20%3D%20USE_UID%5Cn%20%20%20%20create_time_min%20%3D%20CREATE_TIME_MIN%5Cn%20%20%20%20create_time_max%20%3D%20CREATE_TIME_MAX%5Cn%20%20%20%20page%20%3D%20PAGE%5Cn%20%20%20%20page_size%20%3D%20PAGE_SIZE%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23